{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "91cb707c-b123-4a09-91ac-ca8f42aeb987", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 0, "ts": "2026-07-26T17:18:06.595000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "我用示波器仪抓取了波形，命令0x9f和地址0x123464都发送成功了。\n然而读取的时候，fspi并没有释放d0线，d0线被一直拉低，可是日志显示读出数据是0xffffff。\n值得注意的是总线上没有任何别的设备，所以应该不可能是其他设备拉低了数据线。\n我又把地址换成0x123465，结果d0线在读取阶段被保持拉高，看来是顺延了地址的最后一bit状态。\n\n怎么回事呢"}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "91cb707c-b123-4a09-91ac-ca8f42aeb987", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 1, "ts": "2026-07-26T17:18:06.595000+00:00", "role": "tool", "text": "read_file: /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/hardware/rk3576_fspi.h, /home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_fspi.c", "tool_name": "read_file", "tool_call_id": "db-read_file-0", "files_touched": ["/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/hardware/rk3576_fspi.h", "/home/yunline/projects/ovela-dev-workspace/contest2026_062_PharosTech/chips/rk3576/rk3576_fspi.c"]}
{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "91cb707c-b123-4a09-91ac-ca8f42aeb987", "team_id": "contest2026_062_PharosTech", "github_login": "yunline", "tool": "copilot", "seq": 2, "ts": "2026-07-26T17:19:00.601000+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "我用示波器仪抓取了波形，命令0x9f和地址0x123464都发送成功了。\n然而读取的时候，fspi并没有释放d0线，d0线被一直拉低，可是日志显示读出数据是0xffffff。\n值得注意的是总线上没有任何别的设备，所以应该不可能是其他设备拉低了数据线。\n我又把地址换成0x123465，结果d0线在读取阶段被保持拉高，看来是顺延了地址的最后一bit状态。但是读出依然是0xffffff\n\n查询一下github看看有没有issue或者pr提及此事"}
